@startuml
title Caso critico - Inscripcion de estudiante a una seccion y generacion de cobro asociado

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Usuario / Postman" as user
participant "API Gateway\n(pendiente)" as gateway
participant "enrollment-service" as enrollment
participant "course-service\n(validacion planificada)" as course
participant "student-service\n(validacion planificada)" as student
participant "billing-service" as billing
database "PostgreSQL" as pg
queue "RabbitMQ\n(planificado)" as mq
participant "notification\n(planificado)" as notification

note over gateway
La coleccion Postman actual no utiliza gateway.
El acceso real hoy es directo a cada servicio.
end note

group Implementado actualmente
user -> enrollment : POST /api/enrollments {studentId, sectionId}
note right of enrollment
El servicio valida duplicidad de inscripcion activa.
No realiza hoy validacion remota contra
student-service ni course-service.
end note
enrollment -> pg : INSERT enrollment
pg --> enrollment : enrollment_id
enrollment --> user : 201 Created

user -> billing : POST /api/billings {enrollmentId, amount, currency, status=PENDING}
note right of billing
El cobro asociado hoy requiere una segunda llamada
manual/directa.
El servicio valida duplicidad de cobro pendiente.
end note
billing -> pg : INSERT billing
pg --> billing : billing_id
billing --> user : 201 Created

note over student,course
Estos servicios no participan en la secuencia implementada actual.
end note

note over mq,notification
Todavia no se publican eventos ni se consumen notificaciones.
end note
end

== Flujo planeado para entrega final ==
user -> gateway : Solicitud unificada de inscripcion
gateway -> enrollment : POST /api/enrollments
enrollment -> student : Validar existencia y estado del estudiante
student --> enrollment : OK / rechazo
enrollment -> course : Validar seccion, horario y disponibilidad
course --> enrollment : OK / rechazo
enrollment -> pg : Confirmar inscripcion
enrollment -> mq : Publish EnrollmentCreated
mq -> billing : Consume EnrollmentCreated
billing -> pg : Crear cobro PENDING
billing -> mq : Publish BillingCreated
mq -> notification : Consume BillingCreated o NotificationRequested
notification --> mq : ACK
gateway --> user : Respuesta o tracking del proceso

note over enrollment,billing
La coordinacion distribuida, la idempotencia
y la compensacion por fallas siguen planificadas.
end note

@enduml
